        "original_id": "57bcf0b0-4803-5a7d-97b1-556b204fa698",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Priyadarshan, Jackie Shroff, Dimple Kapadia\n- Companies: Shogun Films\n- Products: Gardish, Kabhi Na Kabhi, Gauri: The Unborn\n- Topics: Hindi cinema, Filmfare Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Shroff was born on 1 February 1957, and he is an Indian actor.\n- Gardish is a 1993 Hindi film directed by Priyadarshan and starring Jackie Shroff and Dimple Kapadia.\n- Jackie Shroff was nominated for the Filmfare Best Actor award for Gardish.\n- Dimple Kapadia was nominated for the Filmfare Best Supporting Actress award for Gardish.\n- Shogun Films produced the Hindi films Gardish and Kabhi Na Kabhi, which introduced director Priyadarshan in Bollywood.\n- Shogun Films produced the film Gauri: The Unborn.",
